{
  "key": 46198,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0121_D38R0104_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey!\r",
        "I am the Karate King!\n",
        "I train alone here in the cave!\r",
        "You!\n",
        "Battle with me! Hwaaarggh!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0121_D38R0104_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "I... I’m crushed...\r",
        "My training is still not enough...\n",
        "But a loss is a loss. I admit it.\r",
        "As proof that you defeated me, I’ll give\n",
        "you a rare Fighting-type Pokémon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0121_D38R0104_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received Tyrogue from\n",
        "the Karate King!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0121_D38R0104_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Tyrogue is a Fighting type.\n",
        "It evolves into a tougher Pokémon.\r",
        "Keep up the hard work. I’ll keep\n",
        "training too. Farewell!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0121_D38R0104_00004",
      "en_US": "You have no room in your party!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0121_D38R0104_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Give a nickname to the Tyrogue you\n",
        "received?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0121_D38R0104_00006",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0121_D38R0104_00007",
      "en_US": "Zaza zari za...\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0121_D38R0104_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s Jirachi!\r",
        "...\r",
        "But it appears to be asleep,\n",
        "despite the movement...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0121_D38R0104_00009",
      "en_US": "There’s no way to wake it up..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0121_D38R0104_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} began to play the\n",
        "Azure Flute!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0121_D38R0104_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to try playing the\n",
        "Azure Flute?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0121_D38R0104_00012",
      "en_US": "Jirachi woke up!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0121_D38R0104_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Jirachi asked {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} to\n",
        "choose one wish...\r",
        "But with a warning that the wish\n",
        "could {COLOR 1}only be performed once{COLOR 0}...\r",
        "What does {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s heart desire?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0121_D38R0104_00014",
      "en_US": "The Power of Money"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0121_D38R0104_00015",
      "en_US": "Extreme Gambling"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0121_D38R0104_00016",
      "en_US": "Delicious Sweets"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0121_D38R0104_00017",
      "en_US": "Challenge Jirachi"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0121_D38R0104_00018",
      "en_US": "Jirachi granted your wish...\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0121_D38R0104_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} was given $300,000!\n",
        "(No matter how much room there is...)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0121_D38R0104_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "Jirachi disappeared, not to be\n",
        "seen again for a millenium..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0121_D38R0104_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Coin Case was completely\n",
        "filled!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0121_D38R0104_00022",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} was showered with sweets!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0121_D38R0104_00023",
      "en_US": "Jirachi moved forward to attack!\r"
    },
    {
      "en_US": "",
      "id": "msg_0121_D38R0104_00024"
    }
  ]
}
